{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔～心跳得好快、心跳得好快喔！明白明白安洁非常明白的！”", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0311", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是也不能一直闭着眼睛，就这样走过去的话会撞到墙壁的。所以各位，听安洁数一二三……”", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 43, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0312", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯，安洁，你的成绩进步了呢。”", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0761", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理同学你偷跑啦！安洁还没有做好心理准备的说！”", "text_idx": 410, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0313", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "周休结束的今天，是公布考试结果的日子。", "text_idx": 440, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "于是，安洁领队带大家来看贴在走廊上的名次表。", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁想说一个人看会害怕所以才带大家一起来的～一大早就把安洁的玻璃心打碎太过分了啦爱理同学～！”", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0314", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可是，大家早就都看到了。”", "text_idx": 360, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0762", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯……比预想的成绩还要好太多了……”", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "被濑名教导念书的结果显而易见。甚至我都有点傻眼了。", "text_idx": 480, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小乾其实头脑也很好吧？我输了一大截欸～”", "text_idx": 392, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ht0166", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是当然的啊！区区男人想赢过我，未免也太看得起自己了！”", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "sn0113", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“但是但是小纱同学，你输给新吾同学了呢♪”", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0315", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“咕唔唔！”", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "sn0114", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且安洁的名次真的进步好多……啊啊，爱理同学谢谢你……”", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0316", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“可恨的瓜生，是男人就给我想色色的事情然后把英语单词都忘光光啦……”", "text_idx": 359, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "sn0115", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊，大家～”", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "mu0202", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“噜～！”", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "pn0069", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀呀，美羽学姐樱乃学妹熊喵小姐！”", "text_idx": 361, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0317", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其他年级的天羽学姐和樱乃也来了，安洁和乾同学立刻迎了上去。", "text_idx": 437, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“请看，安洁名次进步了喔！这样一来安洁就不会再被说‘什么都好就是笨’，是个能干的女仆了♪”", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 45, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0318", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“美羽学姐抱歉！我输给瓜生那个色情混帐了，但是、但是名次进步了喔……！”", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "sn0116", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“嗯嗯，大家很努力喔，小菜夏和小纱凪都是。我都有看到喔！”", "text_idx": 383, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "mu0203", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "紗凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，虽然这次小输，但是下一次我一定会努力赢过那个混帐的……！”", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": "纱凪", "alt_speaker_idx": 474, "voice": "sn0117", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "眼前的景象看起来几乎就是“跟妈妈报告成绩的女儿们”，但我不会说出来的。", "text_idx": 471, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～？”", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "pn0070", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“啊啊嗯，比我预想的好太多了。樱乃呢？”", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“很满意。”", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk0396", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我也是喔，很满意呢，欸嘿嘿。”", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "mu0204", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看来，在濑名家里一起念书的大家努力都有了回报，考出了不错的成果。", "text_idx": 469, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "天羽学姐虽然没有直接被濑名教导，但也露出了开心的天使般的笑容。", "text_idx": 444, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以啊，这都是多亏了小爱理，我就邀了小樱乃来道谢了。”", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "mu0205", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "桜乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这么说来，爱理的名次是？”", "text_idx": 418, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "樱乃", "alt_speaker_idx": 459, "voice": "sk0397", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呃，我无所谓啦……”", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0763", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然濑名没有回答，但大家同时看向了２年级的名次表。", "text_idx": 478, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "表单的最上方。那个闪闪发光的名字──“１　濑名爱理（２－Ｔ）”。", "text_idx": 479, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不愧是资优生，年级榜首就是固定位置！”", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0319", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～～♪”", "text_idx": 367, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "pn0071", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呀啊啊！？”", "text_idx": 362, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0764", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哇啊♪呵呵，小熊喵，你是第一名的王冠呢！”", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "mu0206", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜！”", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "pn0072", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好了好了，总之大家来拍纪念照吧？”", "text_idx": 387, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“随便都可以但是先把这只动物抓下来啦！！！”", "text_idx": 423, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0765", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“难得的王冠的说。”", "text_idx": 425, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0320", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不会遗憾第一名的位子吗？”", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "隼太", "alt_speaker_idx": 484, "voice": "ht0167", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“动物跟年级榜首没有关系吧！总之瓜生、快点、瓜生──！”", "text_idx": 357, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0766", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "ぱんにゃ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呜噜～！”", "text_idx": 365, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "熊喵", "alt_speaker_idx": 464, "voice": "pn0073", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "みう", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好像小熊喵有两只一样呢～”", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "美羽", "alt_speaker_idx": 475, "voice": "mu0207", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊哈啊……总、总之！”", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0767", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "顺带一提，最后熊喵是趴在我的头上。", "text_idx": 485, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我只是做跟平常一样的事情而已，没什么好夸奖的喔。”", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0768", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“难得气氛这么热络，泼冷水就太不识趣了喔爱理同学～”", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0321", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然抱歉但安洁说的没错。", "text_idx": 477, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不过，濑名依然……", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“拿我的事来热络有什么意义啊？”", "text_idx": 402, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0769", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……因为大家都得到了好的成果。我真的松了口气，毕竟是我教大家念书的。”", "text_idx": 342, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0770", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "其他人彼此互看了一眼。", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“不、不过，念书准备考试是理所当然的，那也不是什么值得夸奖的事……”", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0771", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她在为大家的成果而高兴。我们都看得出来她很努力不要显露出这个心情。", "text_idx": 445, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都笑了。", "text_idx": 443, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哼、哼嗯。”", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0772", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名红着脸把头转向一旁。", "text_idx": 463, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "班会快要开始了，大家解散后各自回去教室。", "text_idx": 466, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理同学，谢谢你～”", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0322", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "除了我行我素的隼太还是老样子，安洁和乾同学都心情很好地走回自己的座位。", "text_idx": 483, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“呼……”", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0773", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名，真的很谢谢你。”", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我也在回座位前再次向她道谢。", "text_idx": 451, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“就只有你，我才不想被你道谢呢。”", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0774", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学又转开头。", "text_idx": 461, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“只有我”。", "text_idx": 358, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "因为明白她话中的意思，所以即使是这种态度我也很开心。", "text_idx": 441, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“而且……对、对我来说也挺新鲜的。”", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0775", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸？”", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你不是很完美地理解了我教的地方吗？可以说是很有教导的价值……”", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0776", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "听到她不好意思的语气，我忍不住盯着濑名的脸看。", "text_idx": 439, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……你的那种地方、我、那个，不是奇怪的意思……还挺中意的。”", "text_idx": 339, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 31, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0777", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“所以那个，没、没什么啦！”", "text_idx": 400, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0778", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名果然还是别开视线，但是她连耳朵都红了。", "text_idx": 462, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“是、是你很好教的意思喔！很有教的价值，所以那个……”", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0779", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“濑名。”", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“什么啦！？”", "text_idx": 350, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0780", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你还愿意再教我念书吗？”", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我想也没想就问了。", "text_idx": 454, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她给我的感觉让我想这么问。", "text_idx": 447, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以。", "text_idx": 456, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0142", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……嗯。”", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar1146", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "她的点头看起来有点高兴──而我希望这不是我的错觉。", "text_idx": 446, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“哈啊……哈啊……安洁已经不行了，虽然期中考的成绩很好提振了精神，可是这样下去撑不到期末考试……”", "text_idx": 371, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 49, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0323", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“你就是没有考虑分配一口气冲太猛了……”", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0783", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在第三和第四节课中间的下课时间，我们正从理科教室走回原本的教室。", "text_idx": 442, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“喔、爱～理！”", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0057", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……妈妈。”", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0784", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“～♪～～♪”", "text_idx": 426, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0058", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然现身的学园长向大家打声招呼后，一脸开心的表情凑到濑名的身边。", "text_idx": 472, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“兰华小姐，您好像心情很好呢！”", "text_idx": 356, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0324", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“考试的结果我看到了喔♪”", "text_idx": 413, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0059", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“安洁复活得好快！”", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“爱理又是榜首呢～嗯，你好努力喔！”", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0060", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……哼嗯。”", "text_idx": 340, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0785", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "与开心的学园长相反，濑名则是不爽地哼了一声。", "text_idx": 433, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“托你的福成绩还可以。你想说的只有这样？”", "text_idx": 401, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0786", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“既然能考得这么好，稍微放松点也没关系的说。一直绷得这么紧，弦会很容易断喔～”", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0061", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，现在的安洁对这句话有切身之痛。”", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0325", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“一旦放松，那条弦一定就再也没用了。我是这么想的，所以不会让自己变成那样。”", "text_idx": 346, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 38, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0787", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔，这边的论点让安洁感觉到器量的水准不一样呢……！”", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0326", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“大概是因为安洁你现在很虚弱，休息一会恢复体力比较好喔。”", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "话说回来──", "text_idx": 481, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我在惊讶中又重新体认到了这个事实。", "text_idx": 453, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "这一对母女给人的印象本来就差很多，而现在她们说出口的话，根本是完全相反。", "text_idx": 482, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 36, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……期末也加油喔♪”", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0062", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“我已经说了，不会松懈……”", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0788", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这是一个人住的条件对吧？自己说出口的话我不会违背的！”", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0789", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学不耐烦地大喊。", "text_idx": 460, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──我只是做跟平常一样的事情而已。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "原来背后还有这层因素。我跟安洁面面相觑。", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0063", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看到我们的反应，学园长瞪圆了眼睛，不过立刻又露出愉快的微笑。", "text_idx": 468, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“小新吾和安洁，知道你一个人住的事情啊。”", "text_idx": 393, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0064", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“这样啊～哼嗯～欸嘿嘿……”", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0065", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“……我最讨厌你那种笑法了！”", "text_idx": 344, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0790", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“要走了，瓜生、安洁。不好意思让你们看到难堪的一幕……”", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0791", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "アンジェ", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“欸、啊好的！遵命！”", "text_idx": 405, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 449, "voice": "ag0327", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“那就失陪了，学园长！”", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "蘭華", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“好好好，再见啰，‘瓜生’♪”", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": "兰华", "alt_speaker_idx": 435, "voice": "rk0066", "char_id": "蘭華"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "愛理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“唔唔唔……！”", "text_idx": 374, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": "爱理", "alt_speaker_idx": 465, "voice": "ar0792", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "直到最后气氛都糟透了，学园长和濑名各自走向左右两边。", "text_idx": 467, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我跟在濑名身后。", "text_idx": 455, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "好像稍微了解了，但详细情况实在是问不出口。我非常在意这对母女间的气氛。", "text_idx": 448, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 35, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我加快脚步，与濑名并肩。", "text_idx": 452, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "──她正紧咬着下唇。", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "“…………”", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "新吾", "alt_speaker_idx": 457, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_airi_route01_03.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "真的问不出口。", "text_idx": 470, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
